{
  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>롯데월드타워 설계 과정 — 개념 재구성 인터랙티브</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#0f1419;--panel:#182029;--line:#2c3a48;--fg:#eef2f5;--mut:#b4c0cc;--acc:#ffc861;--acc2:#7cc4ff;--warn:#ff9b8a}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Apple SD Gothic Neo\",\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif}\nheader{padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;align-items:baseline}\nh1{font-size:1.25rem;margin:0}\n.badge{font-size:.85rem;background:#24303c;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--acc)}\n.notice{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--warn);margin:0;flex-basis:100%}\nmain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;padding:14px}\n@media (max-width:900px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\nsection{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px}\nh2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0 0 8px}\n#view{position:relative;width:100%;height:62vh;min-height:360px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#0a0e12;outline:none}\n#view:focus-visible{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--acc)}\n#view canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}\n.vlabel{position:absolute;background:rgba(10,14,18,.82);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.85rem;pointer-events:none}\n.btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\nbutton{background:#24303c;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid #3d4f61;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer;min-height:40px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:var(--acc2)}\nbutton:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--acc);outline-offset:2px}\nbutton[aria-pressed=\"true\"],button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:#3a3220;border-color:var(--acc);color:#fff}\nbutton:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default}\n.stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px}\n@media (max-width:600px){.stages{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}\n.stages button{text-align:left;font-size:.85rem}\n#stageText{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--mut);font-size:.93rem;min-height:4.5em}\n.row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}\ninput[type=range]{flex:1;min-width:180px;accent-color:var(--acc);height:32px}\n#svgwrap{background:#f7f5ef;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px}\n#svgwrap svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:62vh}\n.cap{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--mut);margin-top:8px}\n.cap b{color:var(--fg)}\nfooter{padding:4px 18px 20px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mut)}\nfooter a{color:var(--acc2)}\nkbd{background:#24303c;border:1px solid #3d4f61;border-radius:4px;padding:0 5px;font-size:.8rem}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n  <h1>롯데월드타워 설계 과정 읽기</h1>\n  <span class=\"badge\">제작 모델: claude-opus-5.5</span>\n  <p class=\"notice\">※ 공개 자료를 참고한 설명용 개념 재구성입니다. 공식 시공 도면이나 검증된 구조 설계가 아닙니다. <b>[추정]</b> 표시는 공개 자료에 없는 치수·단면·부재를 개념적으로 가정한 값입니다.</p>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"h3d\">\n  <h2 id=\"h3d\">3D 비교: 선택한 설계 단계 ↔ 완성 모델</h2>\n  <div id=\"view\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"application\" aria-label=\"3D 뷰어. 화살표 키로 회전, 플러스·마이너스 키로 확대·축소, R 키로 시점 초기화\">\n    <span class=\"vlabel\" id=\"lblA\"></span><span class=\"vlabel\" id=\"lblB\">완성 모델 (개념 재구성)</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"btns\">\n    <button id=\"bReset\">시점 초기화 (R)</button>\n    <button id=\"bIn\">확대 (+)</button>\n    <button id=\"bOut\">축소 (−)</button>\n    <button id=\"bRot\" aria-pressed=\"false\">자동 회전</button>\n    <button id=\"bGhost\" aria-pressed=\"true\">단계 모델에 완성 윤곽 겹치기</button>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"cap\">드래그: 회전 · 휠/핀치: 확대·축소 · 오른쪽 드래그/두 손가락: 이동 · 키보드: <kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd> 회전, <kbd>+</kbd><kbd>−</kbd> 확대·축소, <kbd>R</kbd> 초기화. 두 화면은 같은 카메라를 공유해 같은 각도에서 비교됩니다.</p>\n  <h2 style=\"margin-top:12px\">설계 발전 단계</h2>\n  <div class=\"stages\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"설계 단계\" id=\"stageBtns\"></div>\n  <p id=\"stageText\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <label for=\"floor\">기준 층 선택: <b id=\"floorOut\"></b></label>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"floor\" min=\"1\" max=\"123\" value=\"60\">\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"cap\">선택한 층은 3D 두 모델의 <span style=\"color:var(--acc)\">노란 링</span>, 입면도·단면도의 노란 선, 평면도의 단면 위치로 동시에 표시됩니다.</p>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"hdw\">\n  <h2 id=\"hdw\">도면 (개념도)</h2>\n  <div role=\"tablist\" class=\"btns\" id=\"dwgTabs\" aria-label=\"도면 종류\"></div>\n  <div id=\"svgwrap\"></div>\n  <div class=\"cap\" id=\"dwgCap\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer>\n  출처(텍스트 참고, 실행 중 불러오지 않음): 원 설계 KPF — <a href=\"https://www.kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kpf.com/project/lotte-world-tower</a> · 구조 설계 LERA — <a href=\"https://www.lera.com/lotte-world-tower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lera.com/lotte-world-tower</a><br>\n  확인 기준값: 높이 555m, 지상 123층, 위로 갈수록 좁아지는 형태, 한국 도자기의 곡선을 참고한 형태(KPF 설명). 그 외 폭·코어·층고·용도 구간·구조 부재 위치는 모두 개념 추정입니다. · 화면 표시 모델: claude-opus-5.5\n</footer>\n\n<script src=\"../runtime/three-runtime.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n\"use strict\";\nconst reduce = matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\nconst H = 555, FLOORS = 123, ROOF = 497;\nconst FH = ROOF / FLOORS;\nconst W0 = 36;\nconst STAGES = [\n {k:\"1. 매스 스터디\", d:\"높이 555m·123층 프로그램을 담는 단순 직육면체에서 출발합니다. 폭 약 72m[추정]의 정방형 평면을 그대로 세운 기준 볼륨으로, 이후 단계와 비교하는 출발점입니다.\"},\n {k:\"2. 테이퍼\", d:\"위로 갈수록 기준층 면적이 줄어드는 프로그램(오피스→레지던스→호텔→전망)에 맞추어 외곽을 직선으로 좁힙니다. 바람에 대한 단면 축소 효과도 개념적으로 설명할 수 있습니다.\"},\n {k:\"3. 도자기 곡선\", d:\"KPF가 설명한 한국 도자기의 선을 참고해, 직선 테이퍼를 완만한 곡선 프로파일로 바꾸고 모서리를 위로 갈수록 둥글게 만듭니다(곡률·지수는 [추정]).\"},\n {k:\"4. 이음선·꼭대기\", d:\"상부에서 하부까지 이어지는 이음선(seam)을 각 면 중앙에 두어 형태를 분절하고, 꼭대기는 좁아지며 열린 크라운으로 마무리합니다. 이음선 위치·폭과 크라운 격자는 [추정] 표현입니다.\"},\n {k:\"5. 구조·완성\", d:\"LERA의 구조 개념(중앙 코어, 메가 기둥, 아웃리거·벨트 트러스)을 개념적으로 겹쳐 보고 포디움(저층 몰)과 함께 완성 형상을 구성합니다. 부재 위치·개수는 [추정]입니다.\"}\n];\nconst ZONES = [\n {a:1,b:12,n:\"저층부·로비/리테일\",c:\"#c9d6df\"},\n {a:13,b:38,n:\"오피스\",c:\"#a8c7e8\"},\n {a:39,b:71,n:\"레지던스/오피스텔\",c:\"#b9dfb6\"},\n {a:72,b:101,n:\"호텔\",c:\"#f2d49b\"},\n {a:102,b:116,n:\"프리미엄 오피스 등\",c:\"#e3b9d8\"},\n {a:117,b:123,n:\"전망대\",c:\"#f4a99a\"}\n];\nconst OUTRIG = [40,72,102];\nlet stage = 4, floor = 60, dwg = \"plan\", ghost = true, autoRot = false;\n\nfunction halfW(h, s){ const t=Math.min(Math.max(h/H,0),1);\n  if(s===0) return W0; if(s===1) return W0-28*t; return W0-30*Math.pow(t,1.7); }\nfunction expo(h, s){ const t=h/H; if(s===0) return 14; if(s===1) return 8; return 5-2.6*t; }\nfunction supPt(a, w, n){ const c=Math.cos(a), s=Math.sin(a);\n  return [w*Math.sign(c)*Math.pow(Math.abs(c),2/n), w*Math.sign(s)*Math.pow(Math.abs(s),2/n)]; }\nfunction zoneOf(f){ return ZONES.find(z=>f>=z.a&&f<=z.b); }\nfunction areaAt(h,s){ const w=halfW(h,s),n=expo(h,s); let a=0,N=200,prev=supPt(0,w,n);\n  for(let j=1;j<=N;j++){ const p=supPt(j/N*Math.PI*2,w,n); a+=prev[0]*p[1]-p[0]*prev[1]; prev=p; } return Math.abs(a)/2; }\n\n/* ---------- 3D ---------- */\nconst view=document.getElementById(\"view\");\nconst lblA=document.getElementById(\"lblA\"), lblB=document.getElementById(\"lblB\");\nlet renderer, scene, camera, controls, gB, ok=!!(window.THREE);\nconst M={};\nlet ringA, ringB, ghostLine, vert=false;\n\nfunction loft(s,h0,h1,levels,seg){\n  const pos=[], idx=[];\n  for(let i=0;i<=levels;i++){ const h=h0+(h1-h0)*i/levels, w=halfW(h,s), n=expo(h,s);\n    for(let j=0;j<seg;j++){ const p=supPt(j/seg*Math.PI*2,w,n); pos.push(p[0],h,p[1]); } }\n  for(let i=0;i<levels;i++) for(let j=0;j<seg;j++){ const a=i*seg+j,b=i*seg+(j+1)%seg,c=a+seg,d=b+seg; idx.push(a,c,b,b,c,d); }\n  const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry(); g.setAttribute(\"position\",new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pos,3)); g.setIndex(idx); g.computeVertexNormals(); return g;\n}\nfunction capAt(s,h){ const seg=64,w=halfW(h,s),n=expo(h,s),shape=new THREE.Shape();\n  for(let j=0;j<=seg;j++){ const p=supPt(j/seg*Math.PI*2,w,n); j?shape.lineTo(p[0],-p[1]):shape.moveTo(p[0],-p[1]); }\n  const g=new THREE.ShapeGeometry(shape); g.rotateX(-Math.PI/2); g.translate(0,h,0); return g; }\nfunction seamGeo(s,ang,top){\n  const pos=[], idx=[], L=50, hw=0.9, c=Math.cos(ang), sn=Math.sin(ang);\n  for(let i=0;i<=L;i++){ const h=top*i/L, w=halfW(h,s)+0.25;\n    pos.push(c*w-sn*hw,h,sn*w+c*hw, c*w+sn*hw,h,sn*w-c*hw); }\n  for(let i=0;i<L;i++){ const a=i*2; idx.push(a,a+2,a+1,a+1,a+2,a+3); }\n  const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry(); g.setAttribute(\"position\",new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(pos,3)); g.setIndex(idx); g.computeVertexNormals(); return g;\n}\nfunction ringGeo(s,h,off){ const pts=[], w=halfW(h,s)+off, n=expo(h,s);\n  for(let j=0;j<=96;j++){ const p=supPt(j/96*Math.PI*2,w,n); pts.push(new THREE.Vector3(p[0],h,p[1])); }\n  return new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pts); }\n\nfunction buildStage(s){\n  const g=new THREE.Group();\n  const glass=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:s<2?0x9fb3c4:0xbfd3e2,metalness:.35,roughness:.35,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const top=s>=3?ROOF:H;\n  g.add(new THREE.Mesh(loft(s,0,top,s<2?2:48,64),glass));\n  g.add(new THREE.Mesh(capAt(s,top),glass));\n  if(s>=3){\n    const cm=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xd6e6f2,transparent:true,opacity:.28,side:THREE.DoubleSide,depthWrite:false});\n    g.add(new THREE.Mesh(loft(s,ROOF,H,12,64),cm));\n    const lm=new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xe8eef3});\n    for(let k=0;k<16;k++){ const a=k/16*Math.PI*2, pts=[];\n      for(let i=0;i<=12;i++){ const h=ROOF+(H-ROOF)*i/12, p=supPt(a,halfW(h,s),expo(h,s)); pts.push(new THREE.Vector3(p[0],h,p[1])); }\n      g.add(new THREE.Line(new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pts),lm)); }\n    for(let i=1;i<=4;i++) g.add(new THREE.Line(ringGeo(s,ROOF+(H-ROOF)*i/5,0),lm));\n    const sm=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x2a3542,metalness:.2,roughness:.6,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n    [0,Math.PI/2,Math.PI,Math.PI*1.5].forEach(a=>g.add(new THREE.Mesh(seamGeo(s,a,H),sm)));\n  }\n  if(s>=2){ const fm=new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0x6f8396}); for(let f=10;f<=120;f+=10) g.add(new THREE.Line(ringGeo(s,f*FH,.15),fm)); }\n  if(s>=4){\n    const core=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(30,ROOF,30),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x8c6b4a,transparent:true,opacity:.55}));\n    core.position.y=ROOF/2; g.add(core);\n    const om=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xff7b54});\n    OUTRIG.forEach(f=>{ const h=f*FH, w=halfW(h,s)-1.5;\n      [[1,0],[0,1]].forEach(([x,z])=>{ const b=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(x?w*2:1.5,FH*2,z?w*2:1.5),om); b.position.y=h; g.add(b); });\n      g.add(new THREE.Line(ringGeo(s,h,.4),new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xff7b54}))); });\n    const pm=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x8d98a3,roughness:.8});\n    const p1=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(150,40,90),pm); p1.position.set(10,20,110); g.add(p1);\n    const p2=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(80,28,70),pm); p2.position.set(-95,14,60); g.add(p2);\n  }\n  const ground=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CircleGeometry(260,48),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x1d2731}));\n  ground.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2; ground.position.y=-.2; g.add(ground);\n  return g;\n}\nfunction init3D(){\n  renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true}); renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  view.prepend(renderer.domElement); renderer.setScissorTest(true);\n  scene=new THREE.Scene(); scene.background=new THREE.Color(0x0a0e12);\n  camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35,1,1,5000);\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xdfe9f3,0x202830,1.4));\n  const dl=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,2.2); dl.position.set(300,600,250); scene.add(dl);\n  const OC=THREE.OrbitControls;\n  if(OC){ controls=new OC(camera,renderer.domElement); controls.enableDamping=!reduce; controls.minDistance=120; controls.maxDistance=2500; controls.maxPolarAngle=Math.PI*.52; }\n  for(let s=0;s<5;s++){ M[s]=buildStage(s); M[s].visible=false; scene.add(M[s]); }\n  gB=buildStage(4); scene.add(gB);\n  resetView(); new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(view); resize(); update3D(); loop();\n}\nfunction tgt(){ return controls?controls.target:new THREE.Vector3(0,240,0); }\nfunction resetView(){ camera.position.set(620,420,820); if(controls){controls.target.set(0,240,0);controls.update();} else camera.lookAt(0,240,0); }\nfunction orbit(dTh,dPh){ const t=tgt(), off=camera.position.clone().sub(t), sp=new THREE.Spherical().setFromVector3(off);\n  sp.theta+=dTh; sp.phi=Math.min(Math.PI*.52,Math.max(.05,sp.phi+dPh)); off.setFromSpherical(sp); camera.position.copy(t).add(off); camera.lookAt(t); if(controls) controls.update(); }\nfunction zoom(f){ const t=tgt(), off=camera.position.clone().sub(t); off.setLength(Math.min(2500,Math.max(120,off.length()*f))); camera.position.copy(t).add(off); camera.lookAt(t); if(controls) controls.update(); }\nfunction resize(){ const w=view.clientWidth,h=view.clientHeight; if(!w||!h) return; renderer.setSize(w,h,false); vert=w<560;\n  camera.aspect=vert?w/(h/2):(w/2)/h; camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n  Object.assign(lblA.style,{left:\"8px\",top:\"8px\"}); Object.assign(lblB.style,vert?{left:\"8px\",top:(h/2+8)+\"px\"}:{left:(w/2+8)+\"px\",top:\"8px\"}); }\nfunction update3D(){\n  lblA.textContent=\"선택 단계: \"+STAGES[stage].k;\n  if(!ok||!scene) return;\n  [ringA,ringB,ghostLine].forEach(o=>{ if(o){ scene.remove(o); o.geometry.dispose(); } });\n  const h=floor*FH, rm=new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({color:0xffc861});\n  ringA=new THREE.Line(ringGeo(stage,h,1.2),rm); ringB=new THREE.Line(ringGeo(4,h,1.2),rm); scene.add(ringA,ringB);\n  const pts=[]; for(let i=0;i<=60;i++){ const hh=H*i/60; pts.push(new THREE.Vector3(halfW(hh,4)+.5,hh,0)); }\n  for(let i=60;i>=0;i--){ const hh=H*i/60; pts.push(new THREE.Vector3(-halfW(hh,4)-.5,hh,0)); }\n  ghostLine=new THREE.Line(new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(pts),new THREE